+/* ── the scripts every page gets ────────────────────────────────────────── */
+
+/* WebLoginWindow.swift:75-87, statement for statement. appkey is the login
+ * appkey the official Windows client uses too (bililive-web-host-bridge.md:50)
+ * and the one startLive signs with; buvid3 is the per-install id above.
+ * device_name / device_platform stay the macOS literals the Swift used — the
+ * Windows-correct values are NOT IN SOURCE (session-and-login.md §7.4 row 28),
+ * and inventing them would be a behaviour change, not a port. */
